{"strongs": "H2945", "word": "טַף", "translit": "taph", "root": "טנא", "morph": "H:N-M", "pos": "noun masculine", "gloss": "children", "definition": "טַף 42 noun masculine collective children (as going with quick, tripping steps; Ethiopic Di 1251 ) — טַף Jer 41:16 + 11 t.; טָ֑ף Jer 40:7 + 5 t.; suffix טַפֵּנוּ Gen 43:8 + 5 t.; טַפְּכֶם Gen 45:19 + 10 t.; טַפָּם Gen 34:29 + 6 t.; never construct and never plural (in Gen 47:24 omitted by ᵐ5 , compare Di ); — children, little ones , Gen 34:29 ( E ) + 18 t. J E (Genesis Exodus Numbers), also Deut 1:39 + 8 t. D (including Josh 1:14 ; Josh 8:35 ); P only Num 31:9 ; Num 31:17 ; Num 31:18 , where note זָכָר בַּטָּ֑ף v Num 31:17 = young boys , and הַטַף בַּנָּשִׁים v Num 31:18 = young girls ; also Judg 18:21 ; Judg 21:10 ; 2Sam 15:22 ; Jer 40:7 ; Jer 41:16 ; Jer 43:6 ; Ezek 9:6 ; 2Chr 20:13 ; 2Chr 31:18 ; Ezra 8:21 ; Esth 3:13 ; Esth 8:11 the words מְתִים וְנָשִׁים וְהַטָ֑ף Deut 2:34 ; Deut 3:6 including all inhabitants; so אֲנָשִׁים וְהַנָּשִׁים וְהַטָּף Deut 31:12 ; Jer 40:7 ; Jer 43:6 טַף distinguished from בָּחוּר וּבְּתוּלָה Ezek 9:6 also from בְּנֵיהֶם 2Chr 20:13 , and from בְנֵיהֶם וּבְנוֺתֵיהֶם 2Chr 31:18 . ** Note that the word includes (or implies) women as well as children, in following: Gen 47:12 ; Exod 12:37 (E), Exod 10:10 ; Exod 10:24 (J), Num 32:16 ; Num 32:17 (J E; compare Di on v Num 32:26 ).", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB3370')\">BDB3370</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H2945')\">H2945</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB3369')\">BDB3369</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB3371')\">BDB3371</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>טַף</bdbheb><sub>42</sub> <b>noun masculine</b> collective <highlightword>children</highlightword> (as going with <highlight>quick, tripping</highlight> steps; Ethiopic <placeholder2140/> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Di')\">Di<sup>1251</sup></lookup>) — <bdbheb>טַף</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 41:16\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"41\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"41\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(24,41,16)\">Jer 41:16</ref> + 11 t.; <bdbheb>טָ֑ף</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 40:7\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"40\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"40\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(24,40,7)\">Jer 40:7</ref> + 5 t.; suffix <bdbheb>טַפֵּנוּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 43:8\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"43\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"43\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(1,43,8)\">Gen 43:8</ref> + 5 t.; <bdbheb>טַפְּכֶם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 45:19\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"45\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"45\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(1,45,19)\">Gen 45:19</ref> + 10 t.; <bdbheb>טַפָּם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 34:29\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"34\" vBegin=\"29\" cEnd=\"34\" vEnd=\"29\" onclick=\"bcv(1,34,29)\">Gen 34:29</ref> + 6 t.; never construct and never plural (in <ref ref=\"Gen 47:24\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"47\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"47\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(1,47,24)\">Gen 47:24</ref> omitted by <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb></lookup>, compare <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Di')\">Di</lookup>); — <highlight>children, little ones</highlight>, <ref ref=\"Gen 34:29\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"34\" vBegin=\"29\" cEnd=\"34\" vEnd=\"29\" onclick=\"bcv(1,34,29)\">Gen 34:29</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>) + 18 t. <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup> (Genesis Exodus Numbers), also <ref ref=\"Deut 1:39\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"39\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"39\" onclick=\"bcv(5,1,39)\">Deut 1:39</ref> + 8 t. <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('D')\"><reflink>D</reflink></lookup> (including <ref ref=\"Josh 1:14\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(6,1,14)\">Josh 1:14</ref>; <ref ref=\"Josh 8:35\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"35\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"35\" onclick=\"bcv(6,8,35)\">Josh 8:35</ref>); <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup> only <ref ref=\"Num 31:9\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(4,31,9)\">Num 31:9</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 31:17\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(4,31,17)\">Num 31:17</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 31:18\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(4,31,18)\">Num 31:18</ref>, where note <bdbheb>זָכָר בַּטָּ֑ף</bdbheb> v<ref ref=\"Num 31:17\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(4,31,17)\">Num 31:17</ref> = <highlight>young boys</highlight>, and <bdbheb>הַטַף בַּנָּשִׁים</bdbheb> v<ref ref=\"Num 31:18\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(4,31,18)\">Num 31:18</ref> = <highlight>young girls</highlight>; also <ref ref=\"Judg 18:21\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(7,18,21)\">Judg 18:21</ref>; <ref ref=\"Judg 21:10\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(7,21,10)\">Judg 21:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Sam 15:22\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(10,15,22)\">2Sam 15:22</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 40:7\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"40\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"40\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(24,40,7)\">Jer 40:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 41:16\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"41\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"41\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(24,41,16)\">Jer 41:16</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 43:6\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"43\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"43\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(24,43,6)\">Jer 43:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 9:6\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(26,9,6)\">Ezek 9:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Chr 20:13\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(14,20,13)\">2Chr 20:13</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Chr 31:18\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(14,31,18)\">2Chr 31:18</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezra 8:21\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(15,8,21)\">Ezra 8:21</ref>; <ref ref=\"Esth 3:13\" b=\"17\" cBegi